{"parentUuid":"bc4e1d8e-3355-4602-8e7e-4c13d0ad254b","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"76c8a85b-9e5d-4df7-b5d3-c81e65169492","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","content":"Exit code 1\n\nAccessibility track picked up 2026-09-21 (user-directed). Axe baseline went **107 → 0** and the gate grew from 9 to **22 surfaces (every route)** — I claimed \"every route\" at 21; a docs review diffing the spec against `App.tsx` + `admin/routes.tsx` found `/connections/:id/edit` missing (#2059). Enumerate routes against the router before claiming coverage.\n\n**Merged:** #2050 (#1988 closed — `settle()` before each axe scan), #2052 (contrast tokens, both themes), #2053 (#1980 closed — `Filter` is a real `<label htmlFor>`, every `Progress` named). **Also merged:** #2055 (#2054 closed — `ScrollableTableFocus` shell helper, tertiary/placeholder/link tokens), #2056 (#1671 pt 1 — `components/shared/StatusTag.tsx`, `SEVERITY_TEXT`, `.dq-sr-only`), #2057 (#1671 pt 2a — hatched failed bars, `charts/StatusMarker`). **Later the same day, also merged:** #2058 (progress.md), #2059 (connection-edit scan → 22 surfaces), #2060 (#1671 CLOSED — 3:1 light-theme severity FILLS, `tests/a11y/tokens.test.ts` holding token VALUES to WCAG ratios in both themes, `StatusMarkerKey`, string-typed tags on `StatusTag`, dead `pipelineStatusColor` removed), #2062 (#2048 CLOSED — every scan runs per theme, 44 scans, `route:/…@dark`, each asserts `data-theme` first). **Also merged, late:** #2063 (#1672 slice 1 — `shared/RowLink` on six mouse-only drill-downs, skip link, focus moves to `<main>` on pathname change UNLESS focus is still on a live control inside main; `e2e/keyboard.spec.ts`), #2065 (progress.md, current through #2065), #2066 (#2049 CLOSED — `utils/pageTitle.ts` + `shared/PageTitle` mounted INSIDE the auth gate; sign-in and the crash boundary title themselves), #2069 (`tests/a11y/scanCoverage.test.ts` parses the routers and fails on a declared route with no scan; the Forbidden page is scanned as a Member, `route:/403`, never skipped in CI). **14 PRs merged; `main` verified green at 24e3f180: 1445 unit tests, 46 a11y scans (23 surfaces × 2 themes) + 9 keyboard tests, baseline 0.** NOTHING DEPLOYED (frontend-only, no migrations). Scratch stacks TORN DOWN at session end.\n\n**Filed (open):** #2051 ratchet blind spots (under-reporting, overlays never opened, a node axe silently skips) · #2061 print/PDF from dark theme inherits dark tokens · #2064 navigation never resets scroll · #2067 detail pages titled generically (needs a `usePageTitle(name)` hook) · #2068 latent: `RunDetail`/`useAsyncData` does not refetch when the route param changes on a mounted instance (unreproduced — establish reachability first).\n\n**Queue (start in a FRESH session — each is sizeable):** rest of #1672 (Monaco Tab trap — no a11y option set anywhere in `src/`; lineage graph keyboard path; drawer/modal focus trap+restore audit) → #1673 (landmarks, table captions, aria-live run progress, chart text alternatives — needs a seeded check WITH trend history, none exists, which is also why #2057's markers were never seen on a live chart) → #2051 → #2061 → #2064 → #2067 → #2068. `docs/progress.md` needs one more Snapshot refresh: after #2065 the count moved +1 net (#2067/#2068 filed, #2049 closed).\n\n**Why:** the automated gate is necessary and badly insufficient. Every `/code-review` this session caught something axe structurally could not — see [[feedback-axe-gate-blind-spots]].\n\n**How to apply:** scratch a11y stack = `DOCS_DB_NAME=dataq_a11y DOCS_KV_MOUNT=a11y-scratch TMPDIR=<scratchpad> bash scripts/docs/capture-stack.sh start` (api :8001, Vite :3001; the command never returns because nohup children hold the pipe — background it and poll `/api/v1/me`), then `E2E_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3001 pnpm exec playwright test e2e/a11y.spec.ts --project=chromium --workers=1`. `E2E_BASE_URL` does NOT persist between Bash calls — without it Playwright silently hits the prod-mirror stack on :3000. OTP lane beside compose: `OTP_SMTP_PORT=1026 OTP_SINK_PORT=1081 OTP_REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/4` + own `DATABASE_URL`. Dark mode in a probe: `addInitScript(() => localStorage.setItem('dq-theme-mode','dark'))`. A green-but-BLOCKED PR = an unresolved review thread, incl. CodeQL's bot threads (#2055: CodeQL resolved `ResizeObserver` to the arg-less polyfill class in `tests/setup.ts` — fixed the polyfill, then `resolveReviewThread`). The `PostToolUse` \"PR merged — update progress.md\" hook fires on `gh pr merge --auto` (arming), not on actual merge.\n(eval):1: ==== not found","is_error":true,"tool_use_id":"toolu_01S1kNomaxvbcv9bwRryqBTE"}]},"uuid":"d577bd27-00fe-45f3-9b2f-112d03475aab","timestamp":"2026-10-21T03:36:54.766Z","toolUseResult":"Error: Exit code 1\n\nAccessibility track picked up 2026-09-21 (user-directed). Axe baseline went **107 → 0** and the gate grew from 9 to **22 surfaces (every route)** — I claimed \"every route\" at 21; a docs review diffing the spec against `App.tsx` + `admin/routes.tsx` found `/connections/:id/edit` missing (#2059). Enumerate routes against the router before claiming coverage.\n\n**Merged:** #2050 (#1988 closed — `settle()` before each axe scan), #2052 (contrast tokens, both themes), #2053 (#1980 closed — `Filter` is a real `<label htmlFor>`, every `Progress` named). **Also merged:** #2055 (#2054 closed — `ScrollableTableFocus` shell helper, tertiary/placeholder/link tokens), #2056 (#1671 pt 1 — `components/shared/StatusTag.tsx`, `SEVERITY_TEXT`, `.dq-sr-only`), #2057 (#1671 pt 2a — hatched failed bars, `charts/StatusMarker`). **Later the same day, also merged:** #2058 (progress.md), #2059 (connection-edit scan → 22 surfaces), #2060 (#1671 CLOSED — 3:1 light-theme severity FILLS, `tests/a11y/tokens.test.ts` holding token VALUES to WCAG ratios in both themes, `StatusMarkerKey`, string-typed tags on `StatusTag`, dead `pipelineStatusColor` removed), #2062 (#2048 CLOSED — every scan runs per theme, 44 